02:00047906 671C            	  3172:     beq  _L_z07_BeginUpdateWorld_LoopObject
                            	  3173:     ; If Link's X has not changed since the last frame
                            	  3174:     ; (when Link was the target), then XOR the chase target
                            	  3175:     ; coordinates (which were Link's coordinates last frame).
                            	  3176:     ;
                            	  3177:     ; This ends up reflecting Link's coordinates across the room;
                            	  3178:     ; so that monsters chase away from him.
                            	  3179:     ;
